        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(2(\\frac{3}{a}+\\frac{4}{b})\\ge27\\)，即 \\(\\frac{3}{a}+\\frac{4}{b}\\ge\\frac{27}{2}\\)"
